Description: Add S5K3M5 properties and Software ISP gain conversion
 Use the factory 1 um pixel pitch and RAW10 black level 64. The kernel
 analogue-gain control exposes register codes in units of 1/32 gain.
 Exposure and gain take effect two frames after a SOF-triggered write;
 frame duration changes in the following frame. These delays were measured
 on LM-G820N at 4032x3024 30 fps and 2016x1136 60 fps, with ten changes per
 control/mode.
Forwarded: no

